{"seq":2,"slug":"osmotic-dehydration","title":"渗透脱水：温和前处理的传质工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/food-processing/drying-concentration/osmotic-dehydration","wordCount":3153,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"渗透脱水-温和前处理的传质工程\">渗透脱水：温和前处理的传质工程</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>渗透脱水（Osmotic Dehydration, OD）是将食品浸入高渗透压溶液（高浓度糖液或盐液）中，利用食品细胞膜的半透性和浓度梯度驱动力，在常温或温和温度（25-60°C）下实现食品中水分向外迁移的温和脱水技术。渗透脱水通常不作为最终干燥步骤使用——其脱水程度有限（典型去除 30-50% 水分），而是作为后续干燥（热风、冷冻干燥）或冷冻前的预处理，通过预降低水分含量来缩短后续高能耗加工的时间和成本。</p>\n<p>渗透脱水的独特价值在于其温和性——整个过程在食品热变性温度以下进行，不引起淀粉糊化、蛋白质变性或挥发性风味散失，是特别适合热敏性果蔬制品的前处理技术。同时，渗透溶质（糖、盐）的渗入还能改善产品风味、质构和稳定性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>渗透脱水是一个以&quot;浓度梯度驱动的传质&quot;取代&quot;热驱动蒸发&quot;的温和脱水过程，其核心概念如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>双向（三向）传质</strong>：渗透脱水同时发生三种传质——水分从食品流向溶液（期望、较快）、溶质从溶液渗入食品（适度期望、较慢）、天然溶质（维生素、矿物质、酸）从食品流失（不期望、最慢）。理想设计是&quot;最大化水分外流、适度控制溶质渗入、最小化营养流失&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>驱动力是水分活度差</strong>：不同于热风干燥由热量驱动，渗透脱水由食品与渗透液之间的水分活度梯度驱动，因此不需要高温，常温即可进行。</li>\n<li><strong>前处理定位</strong>：它本身脱除约 30-50% 水分，达不到安全贮藏所需含水率，因此是&quot;预脱水&quot;手段，与后续热风/冻干/速冻/油炸工序形成协同，降低后续高能耗工序的时间与成本。</li>\n<li><strong>边界与常见误解</strong>：渗透脱水不是&quot;泡糖水就变甜&quot;——溶质渗入是把双刃剑，既改善风味也可能造成营养流失与质构变化；脱水会在渗透平衡时停止（驱动力消失），并非时间越长越好；高浓度渗透液抑菌但非无菌，40° Brix 下多数细菌仍能生长。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"传质原理\">传质原理</h2><h3 id=\"三向传质过程\">三向传质过程</h3><p>渗透脱水过程中发生三种同时进行的质量传递：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[食品内部] --&gt;|&quot;水分外流&lt;br/&gt;(主要传质)&quot;| B[渗透液]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;溶质渗入&lt;br/&gt;(次要传质)&quot;| A&#10;    A --&gt;|&quot;天然溶质流出&lt;br/&gt;(不期望)&quot;| B\">graph LR\n    A[食品内部] --&gt;|\"水分外流&lt;br/&gt;(主要传质)\"| B[渗透液]\n    B --&gt;|\"溶质渗入&lt;br/&gt;(次要传质)\"| A\n    A --&gt;|\"天然溶质流出&lt;br/&gt;(不期望)\"| B</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>传质方向</th>\n<th>驱动力</th>\n<th>期望程度</th>\n<th>典型速率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>水分从食品→渗透液</td>\n<td>水分活度梯度</td>\n<td>高度期望</td>\n<td>较快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>溶质从渗透液→食品</td>\n<td>浓度梯度</td>\n<td>适度期望（增味/保护）</td>\n<td>较慢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>天然溶质（有机酸、矿物质、维生素）从食品→渗透液</td>\n<td>浓度梯度</td>\n<td>不期望（营养流失）</td>\n<td>最慢</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>选择性传质的关键</strong>：理想的渗透脱水应最大化水分外流、适度控制溶质渗入、最小化营养素流失。细胞膜的选择透过性是实现这一目标的天然屏障——完整的细胞膜优先通过小分子水而限制大分子溶质的自由扩散。</p>\n<h3 id=\"传质动力学模型\">传质动力学模型</h3><p>水分流失率随时间的变化通常用 Fick 第二定律描述：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∇</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\partial C_w}{\\partial t} = D_{eff} \\cdot \\nabla^2 C_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0141em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∇</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为水分浓度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{eff}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为有效扩散系数。</p>\n<p>对于平板状食材，积分解为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></munderover><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{M_t - M_\\infty}{M_0 - M_\\infty} = \\frac{8}{\\pi^2} \\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty} \\frac{1}{(2n+1)^2} \\exp\\left[-\\frac{(2n+1)^2 \\pi^2 D_{eff} t}{4L^2}\\right]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∞</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"ma