d\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>有效扩散系数的典型值：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>食品</th>\n<th>温度</th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{eff}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（水分）</th>\n<th>参考条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>苹果片</td>\n<td>40°C</td>\n<td>2-5 × 10⁻¹⁰ m²/s</td>\n<td>60° Brix 蔗糖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>芒果片</td>\n<td>50°C</td>\n<td>3-8 × 10⁻¹⁰ m²/s</td>\n<td>65° Brix 蔗糖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>猪肉片</td>\n<td>30°C</td>\n<td>1-3 × 10⁻¹⁰ m²/s</td>\n<td>20% NaCl</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>草莓</td>\n<td>40°C</td>\n<td>1-4 × 10⁻¹⁰ m²/s</td>\n<td>50° Brix 蔗糖</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"peleg-经验模型\">Peleg 经验模型</h3><p>由于 Fick 模型求解复杂，工程实践中常用 Peleg 经验模型描述渗透脱水动力学：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>W</mi><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>W</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>t</mi><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{WL(t)}{WL_\\infty} = \\frac{t}{k_1 + k_2 \\cdot t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.263em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∞</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1281em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2921em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">WL</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 为水分损失率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为初始速率参数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为极限值参数。该模型简单实用，参数可通过线性回归直接获得。</p>\n<h2 id=\"影响因素\">影响因素</h2><h3 id=\"渗透溶液特性\">渗透溶液特性</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>溶质类型</th>\n<th>浓度范围</th>\n<th>脱水效率</th>\n<th>溶质渗入程度</th>\n<th>主要应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>蔗糖</td>\n<td>40-70° Brix</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>果蔬蜜饯、果干</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>葡萄糖</td>\n<td>40-60° Brix</td>\n<td>高（分子小→渗入多）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>经济型脱水</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>麦芽糊精</td>\n<td>30-50%</td>\n<td>中低</td>\n<td>极低（分子大）</td>\n<td>限制渗入型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>海藻糖</td>\n<td>40-60%</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>生物保护</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NaCl</td>\n<td>10-25%</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>肉类、蔬菜</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NaCl + 蔗糖</td>\n<td>混合</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>可调</td>\n<td>优化方案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>甘油</td>\n<td>40-70%</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中间水分产品</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>分子量效应</strong>：高分子量溶质（如麦芽糊精 DE10, MW&gt;3000）虽然产生的渗透压较低（摩尔浓度低），但因分子尺寸大而无法穿过细胞膜，从而实现&quot;最大化脱水、最小化溶质渗入&quot;的理想传质选择性。</p>\n<h3 id=\"工艺参数影响\">工艺参数影响</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>增加时的影响</th>\n<th>最优范围</th>\n<th>注意事项</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>温度</td>\n<td>脱水加速、渗入也加速</td>\n<td>30-50°C</td>\n<td>&gt;60°C 引起热损伤</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>溶液浓度</td>\n<td>脱水加速</td>\n<td>50-70° Brix</td>\n<td>过高粘度限制传质</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>浸泡时间</td>\n<td>脱水增加但递减</td>\n<td>2-8h（常规）</td>\n<td>长时间溶质渗入增加</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>食品/溶液比</td>\n<td>低比值（溶液量大）维持恒浓</td>\n<td>1:4 ~ 1:10</td>\n<td>经济性限制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>搅拌</td>\n<td>加速传质</td>\n<td>温和搅拌</td>\n<td>避免机械损伤</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>食品厚度</td>\n<td>越薄传质越快</td>\n<td>5-15mm</td>\n<td>过薄操作困难</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"食品组织结构的影响\">食品组织结构的影响</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[食品组织结构] --&gt; B[细胞壁完整性]&#10;    A --&gt; C[细胞间隙]&#10;    A --&gt; D[膜通透性]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;完整→传质慢但选择性好&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[&quot;破损→传质快但选择性差&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;大间隙→溶液渗透路径&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[&quot;温度升高→膜通透性增加&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[&quot;预处理→膜损伤改变传质&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[食品组织结构] --&gt; B[细胞壁完整性]\n    A --&gt; C[细胞间隙]\n    A --&gt; D[膜通透性]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"完整→传质慢但选择性好\"]\n    B --&gt; B2[\"破损→传质快但选择性差\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[\"大间隙→溶液渗透路径\"]\n    D --&gt; D1[\"温度升高→膜通透性增加\"]\n    D --&gt; D2[\"预处理→膜损伤改变传质\"]</pre><p><strong>预处理对渗透脱水的影响：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>预处理</th>\n<th>对传质的影响</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>漂烫</td>\n<td>加速 2-3 倍</td>\n<td>细胞膜损伤→选择性降低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冻融</td>\n<td>大幅加速</td>\n<td>冰晶破坏细胞结构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超声波</td>\n<td>加速 30-50%</td>\n<td>空化效应→微通道形成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PEF 处理</td>\n<td>加速 50-100%</td>\n<td>电穿孔→膜通透性增加</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>真空脉冲</td>\n<td>加速 50-100%</td>\n<td>气体排出→液体浸入间隙</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"强化技术\">强化技术</h2><h3 id=\"真空渗透脱水-vod\">真空渗透脱水（VOD）</h3><p>真空脉冲渗透脱水（Vacuum Osmotic Dehydration）在渗透脱水初期施加短暂真空脉冲：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>抽真空</strong>（5-10 min, 5-10 kPa）：排出细胞间隙中的气体</li>\n<li><strong>恢复常压</strong>：渗透液在压差驱动下快速填充气体排出后的空隙</li>\n<li><strong>继续常压浸泡</strong>：正常渗透脱水进行</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>效果</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>初期脱水速率提升 50-100%</li>\n<li>渗透液与食品接触面积增大（填充间隙）</li>\n<li>特别适合多孔质食品（苹果、梨等）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"超声波辅助渗透脱水\">超声波辅助渗透脱水</h3><p>超声波（20-40 kHz）在渗透脱水过程中产生的声空化和微射流效应：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>在固-液界面产生微搅拌→消除边界层阻力</li>\n<li>空化气泡坍塌→在食品表面形成微通道</li>\n<li>声辐射压→产生&quot;海绵效应&quot;交替压缩-膨胀</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>典型增强效果</strong>：水分有效扩散系数提升 30-100%</p>\n<h3 id=\"脉冲电场辅助\">脉冲电场辅助</h3><p>PEF 预处理（0.5-3 kV/cm, 1-10 kJ/kg）通过电穿孔增加细胞膜通透性：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>条件</th>\n<th>无 PEF</th>\n<th>PEF 预处理后</th>\n<th>提升比例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>苹果 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{eff}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（水）</td>\n<td>2.5×10⁻¹⁰ m²/s</td>\n<td>5.8×10⁻¹⁰ m²/s</td>\n<td>132%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>脱水 4h 后水分损失</td>\n<td>32%</td>\n<td>48%</td>\n<td>50%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>等效脱水时间缩短</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>40-60%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"渗透液管理\">渗透液管理</h2><h3 id=\"溶液再利用\">溶液再利用</h3><p>工业渗透脱水过程中渗透液会逐渐稀释（吸收食品水分）和积累天然溶质（有机酸、色素等），需要再浓缩或更新：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[渗透脱水] --&gt; B[稀释的渗透液]&#10;    B --&gt; C[再浓缩]&#10;    C --&gt; D[蒸发浓缩]&#10;    C --&gt; E[膜浓缩]&#10;    D --&gt; F[回收至初始浓度]&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; A&#10;    B --&gt; G[质量监控]&#10;    G --&gt; H[&quot;pH/色泽/微生物&lt;br/&gt;超标则部分更换&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[渗透脱水] --&gt; B[稀释的渗透液]\n    B --&gt; C[再浓缩]\n    C --&gt; D[蒸发浓缩]\n    C --&gt; E[膜浓缩]\n    D --&gt; F[回收至初始浓度]\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; A\n    B --&gt; G[质量监控]\n    G --&gt; H[\"pH/色泽/微生物&lt;br/&gt;超标则部分更换\"]</pre><p><strong>再利用循环次数</strong>通常限制为 5-10 次，之后渗透液中积累的杂质（色素、有机酸、微生物代谢物）可能影响产品品质。</p>\n<h3 id=\"微生物控制\">微生物控制</h3><p>高浓度渗透液本身具有一定抑菌能力（低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），但并非无菌环境：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>渗透液浓度</th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>微生物风险</th>\n<th>控制措施</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>40° Brix</td>\n<td>0.93</td>\n<td>大多数细菌可生长</td>\n<td>需冷藏/加热灭菌</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>55° Brix</td>\n<td>0.87</td>\n<td>部分耐渗酵母可生长</td>\n<td>定期加热/更换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>70° Brix</td>\n<td>0.76</td>\n<td>仅极端嗜渗菌</td>\n<td>相对安全</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>25% NaCl</td>\n<td>0.80</td>\n<td>嗜盐菌可生长</td>\n<td>温度控制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"产品品质\">产品品质</h2><h3 id=\"质构变化\">质构变化</h3><p>渗透脱水对食品质构的影响是&quot;双刃剑&quot;：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>正面</strong>：糖渗入增加细胞膨压支撑→维持某些产品的脆性</li>\n<li><strong>负面</strong>：过度脱水→细胞坍塌→组织皱缩</li>\n<li><strong>玻璃化保护</strong>：高浓度糖渗入后的冷冻保护——降低冰晶形成温度、减小冰晶尺寸</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"营养成分变化\">营养成分变化</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>营养素</th>\n<th>渗透脱水中的变化</th>\n<th>主要损失途径</th>\n<th>保留策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>维生素 C</td>\n<td>损失 10-30%</td>\n<td>向溶液扩散</td>\n<td>缩短时间/降低温度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>酚类化合物</td>\n<td>损失 5-20%</td>\n<td>向溶液扩散</td>\n<td>高分子量渗透剂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>矿物质</td>\n<td>损失 10-25%</td>\n<td>向溶液扩散</td>\n<td>低食品/溶液比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>花青素</td>\n<td>损失 10-30%</td>\n<td>扩散+氧化</td>\n<td>低温+抗氧化剂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类胡萝卜素</td>\n<td>基本不损失</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>脂溶性不溶于糖液</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"与后续干燥的协同\">与后续干燥的协同</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>后续工艺</th>\n<th>渗透脱水前处理的优势</th>\n<th>综合效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>热风干燥</td>\n<td>缩短干燥时间 30-50%→减少热暴露</td>\n<td>色泽/质构更好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冷冻干燥</td>\n<td>减少需升华的冰量→节省时间和能耗</td>\n<td>成本降低 20-40%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>速冻</td>\n<td>预脱水减少冰晶形成量→冻结损伤减小</td>\n<td>解冻质量更好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>油炸</td>\n<td>含水量低→油温降幅小→吸油少</td>\n<td>脂肪含量降低 15-30%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"工业应用案例\">工业应用案例</h2><h3 id=\"案例一-蜜饯-果脯生产\">案例一：蜜饯/果脯生产</h3><p>传统蜜饯加工本质上就是渗透脱水的经典应用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>原料</strong>：新鲜水果（杏、李、桃、柚皮等）</li>\n<li><strong>前处理</strong>：清洗→切分→硫处理（护色）→CaCl₂ 浸泡（硬化）</li>\n<li><strong>渗透</strong>：分级糖渍——初始 30° Brix → 逐步升至 70° Brix，每级 24h</li>\n<li><strong>后处理</strong>：沥干→热风干燥（55-65°C, 12-24h）至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>w</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 0.65-0.70</li>\n<li><strong>产品</strong>：含糖量 65-75%，含水 15-20%，常温保质期 12+ 月</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"案例二-高端冻干水果片前处理\">案例二：高端冻干水果片前处理</h3><p>某冻干果蔬工厂利用渗透脱水优化冻干效率：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>原料</strong>：芒果片（10mm 厚）</li>\n<li><strong>渗透条件</strong>：55° Brix 蔗糖液，45°C，4h，超声辅助（25 kHz）</li>\n<li><strong>脱水效果</strong>：水分从 85% 降至 55%（去除约 35% 水分）</li>\n<li><strong>后续冻干</strong>：周期从标准 48h 缩短至 28h（节省 42%）</li>\n<li><strong>品质对比</strong>：色差 ΔE 降低 25%（相比直接冻干），糖渗入改善甜味</li>\n<li><strong>经济效益</strong>：冻干能耗降低 35%，设备产能利用率提升 50%</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"案例三-出口腌制蔬菜\">案例三：出口腌制蔬菜</h3><p>某蔬菜加工企业的出口产品线：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>产品</strong>：渗透脱水半干番茄（Semi-dried Tomato）</li>\n<li><strong>工艺</strong>：切半去籽→8% NaCl + 5% 蔗糖混合液→35°C/6h→低温热风 50°C/4h</li>\n<li><strong>产品</strong>：水分活度 0.88，含盐 3-4%，冷藏保质期 6 个月</li>\n<li><strong>市场</strong>：供应欧洲即食沙拉市场，售价为鲜番茄的 8-10 倍</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"技术局限与发展方向\">技术局限与发展方向</h2><h3 id=\"当前局限\">当前局限</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>局限</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n<th>改进方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>脱水程度有限</td>\n<td>渗透平衡→驱动力消失</td>\n<td>多级处理/浓度递增</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>处理时间长</td>\n<td>扩散传质本质慢</td>\n<td>超声/PEF/真空辅助</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>溶质渗入</td>\n<td>浓度梯度不可避免</td>\n<td>大分子渗透剂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渗透液管理</td>\n<td>稀释/污染需再浓缩</td>\n<td>膜浓缩再利用系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>营养流失</td>\n<td>水溶性成分向外扩散</td>\n<td>缩短时间/低温</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>批量不均匀</td>\n<td>食材大小/成熟度差异</td>\n<td>分级处理/在线监测</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"发展趋势\">发展趋势</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>智能化渗透系统</strong>：在线监测渗透液浓度、产品水分实时追踪</li>\n<li><strong>组合前处理</strong>：PEF + 渗透脱水 + 微波辅助干燥的集成系统</li>\n<li><strong>功能性浸渍</strong>：利用渗透传质机制将功能性成分（益生元、抗氧化剂）引入食品</li>\n<li><strong>低温渗透 + 冻干联合</strong>：面向高端功能性粉末/片剂的全温和链条</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>渗透脱水技术的核心价值在于其温和性与灵活性——在不引起热变性的条件下实现部分脱水，同时可通过溶质渗入赋予产品额外的风味和稳定性。作为前处理技术，它与后续干燥/冷冻工艺形成互补，通过预降低水分含量缩短高能耗工序的时间，实现品质和经济性的双重优化。传质工程的核心挑战——如何最大化水分外流同时控制溶质渗入——推动了真空脉冲、超声波、PEF 等辅助强化技术的发展，使这一传统技术不断获得新的生命力。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"渗透脱水：温和前处理的传质工程","id":"渗透脱水-温和前处理的传质工程"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"传质原理","id":"传质原理"},{"level":3,"text":"三向传质过程","id":"三向传质过程"},{"level":3,"text":"传质动力学模型","id":"传质动力学模型"},{"level":3,"text":"Peleg 经验模型","id":"peleg-经验模型"},{"level":2,"text":"影响因素","id":"影响因素"},{"level":3,"text":"渗透溶液特性","id":"渗透溶液特性"},{"level":3,"text":"工艺参数影响","id":"工艺参数影响"},{"level":3,"text":"食品组织结构的影响","id":"食品组织结构的影响"},{"level":2,"text":"强化技术","id":"强化技术"},{"level":3,"text":"真空渗透脱水（VOD）","id":"真空渗透脱水-vod"},{"level":3,"text":"超声波辅助渗透脱水","id":"超声波辅助渗透脱水"},{"level":3,"text":"脉冲电场辅助","id":"脉冲电场辅助"},{"level":2,"text":"渗透液管理","id":"渗透液管理"},{"level":3,"text":"溶液再利用","id":"溶液再利用"},{"level":3,"text":"微生物控制","id":"微生物控制"},{"level":2,"text":"产品品质","id":"产品品质"},{"level":3,"text":"质构变化","id":"质构变化"},{"level":3,"text":"营养成分变化","id":"营养成分变化"},{"level":3,"text":"与后续干燥的协同","id":"与后续干燥的协同"},{"level":2,"text":"工业应用案例","id":"工业应用案例"},{"level":3,"text":"案例一：蜜饯/果脯生产","id":"案例一-蜜饯-果脯生产"},{"level":3,"text":"案例二：高端冻干水果片前处理","id":"案例二-高端冻干水果片前处理"},{"level":3,"text":"案例三：出口腌制蔬菜","id":"案例三-出口腌制蔬菜"},{"level":2,"text":"技术局限与发展方向","id":"技术局限与发展方向"},{"level":3,"text":"当前局限","id":"当前局限"},{"level":3,"text":"发展趋势","id":"发展趋势"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"}],"prev":{"title":"喷雾干燥与冷冻干燥：从高效到高品质的干燥技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/food-processing/drying-concentration/spray-freeze-drying"},"next":{"title":"膜浓缩技术：分子级别的冷浓缩","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/food-processing/drying-concentration/membrane-concentration"}}